'''''Pokémon Quiz''''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|ポケモン クイズ|Pokémon Kuizu}}''' ''Pokémon Quiz'') is a question-and-answer segment used in the Japanese and Korean versions of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]'', as opposed to the ''[[Who's That Pokémon?]]'' segment used in the English [[dub]].

Each ''Pokémon Quiz'' starts by featuring the silhouette of a Pokémon on a large card. Then, to the right, four smaller cards with silhouettes appear. One card has a silhouette identical to the first, two have silhouettes of similar Pokémon species, and the remaining {{wp|Joker (playing card)|Joker card}} has the silhouette of {{TRT}}. The objective is for the viewers to find the matching card and remember its location. After the commercial break, the quiz reveals the solution, as well as the identities of the Pokémon species silhouetted.

==List of quizzes==
The correct answers are in bold.
