==Trivia==
* A running gag is that whenever {{TRT}} hosts the segment, [[James]] gets cut off or has trouble saying his part.
* In [[XY010]], two cards presenting Piplup and Oshawott below right to Chespin and Team Rocket decoy cards are likely a reference to {{OP|Dawn|Piplup}} and {{OP|Ash|Oshawott}}.
* [[XY051]] and [[XY079]] are the only episodes that don't present the Team Rocket decoy card.
* [[XY078]] is the only episode not to feature this segment.
* In [[XY087]], the answer is {{p|Tyrantrum}}, but only its silhouette is shown.
* In [[XY133]] and [[XY136]], the two other Pokémon, {{p|Charizard}} and {{p|Infernape}} in [[XY133]] and {{p|Sceptile}} and {{p|Krookodile}} in [[XY136]] are Pokémon that Ash has.

